## UI and colors
We neutralised base colors, reducing the blue component. The contrast between text, buttons, and the background was reduced. The reduced backdrop blur on Windows and macOS also accounts for slightly lower GPU usage.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
