## Improved autocomplete rescan
:::note
This is an optional feature; __you can switch it on__ in the Editor section of the settings. The kernel actively discovers newly loaded packages with every `Get` or `Needs` call
:::

Autocomplete now resolves symbols loaded using context aliases. For example:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Improved autocomplete rescan
:::note
This is an optional feature; __you can switch it on__ in the Editor section of the settings. The kernel actively discovers newly loaded packages with every `Get` or `Needs` call
:::

Autocomplete now resolves symbols loaded using context aliases. For example:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Needs["Quaternions`"->"qa`"]

